# Riverglades (44-45): the second Horde visit of the Riverglades, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/riverglades_44_45.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Riverglades, area 16591).
# The guide's quest list is section 7 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md: Powderfuse Port
# and the Eastsea pirates, Na'zok's farm, the rest of the Bloodmaster's Ring, Da'grosh and the
# Twilight's Shroud.
# Left out: A Token of Vengeance (94975), Tome of Twilight (94972) and Eye of Mugg (94968): dungeon
# quests, done inside Krol'dok Stronghold.
# Carried: Lost Shipping Crate (94895, a crate in Desolace) and Overseas Delivery (95144, Innkeeper
# Fizzgrimble in Gadgetzan) are taken in earlier guides and handed in at Powderfuse Port here.
# Left to later guides: On the Other Side (95033, Feralas), I Know a Guy (95295, Booty Bay) and
# Shipping and Handling (95296, Steamwheedle Port).
# Data fixed here: Smuggler's Paradise (95288) needs The Goblin Trader (Horde) or A Few Furs for Friz
# (Alliance), not both; Paletusk Harvesting's Chunks of Boar Meat drop from the Mature Paletusks
# here (outof.games), which the data lacks.
#
# The route: Undercity (training, the auction house) and a flight to Rog'mar; Powderfuse Port and
# three loops from it (the murloc shore, the Eastsea pirates, then Windstead, Na'zok's farm, the
# Jom-jom cave and Bolder'ok); Admiral Lamora's ships; west to Da'grosh and the Twilight's Shroud;
# Rog'mar and the last fights of the Bloodmaster's Ring; the hearthstone back to the port.

guide Riverglades (44-45)
faction horde
levels 44 45
carry 1118 2741 3520 94895 95144
leave 1118 2741 3520 95033 95295 95296
next Feralas (45-46)

# Undercity ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Undercity
note "Back in the Eastern Kingdoms: the zeppelin from Orgrimmar lands at the tower outside Undercity" at 61.0,58.9 in Tirisfal_Glades
train 4593 260093 4582 4606 4566 4563
tip Hunters and shamans can train in Orgrimmar before the zeppelin; druids at their next visit to Thunder Bluff or Moonglade.
ah 95982.1 npc 8672
tip Jasper Geartoggle at Powderfuse Port wants 10 Briny Seafood Stew. Cooks can make them later instead (Cooking 200).
fly "Rog'mar, Riverglades" npc 4551

# Rog'mar ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

